    "question": {
      "pdfName": "Engineering_mathematics_2.pdf",
      "text": "If \\(f(x,y)\\) is a homogeneous function of degree \\(n\\), then the value of\n\\[\ny\\frac{\\partial^2f}{\\partial y^2}\n+x\\frac{\\partial^2f}{\\partial x\\,\\partial y}\n=\n\\]",
